  "description": "PAZTOZ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C94 H140 N9 Na5 O14 Si6 Yb4,C4 H8 O1. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.560-3.672 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.71-113.18°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Yb4(μ4-O)(NHPh)3(OSiMe2NPh)6Na5(thf)7]·THF / C99H137N9Na5O14Si6Yb4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
